{
  "_readme": [
    "How many of an item fit in one stack. The stack ladder in classify.ts stops here:",
    "no block is written for a stack this table says cannot exist.",
    "",
    "Lookup order is byName, then byCategory, then default. Name wins because the",
    "categories are PoeWatch's filing, not the game's - Crystallised Lifeforce is filed",
    "under 'currency' and does not stack like currency.",
    "",
    "byName lists every currency PoeWatch prices, plus the splinters, which are filed",
    "under fragment, ritual and maps. Anything not listed takes byCategory or default.",
    "A name that matches nothing in the league is ignored rather than an error.",
    "",
    "Divination cards are absent on purpose: their stack size varies by card, so they",
    "are never stack-gated and are always tiered at a single card."
  ],
